{"steam_appid":3967470,"steam_name":"We Gotta Go","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3967470/35403412/ad6e7a52512aeaa718457d5d360281670c0f14bf/1775754684/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776185372","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257316897/a43f8c48c7a0655f5be7ecbcd7ba768c2fd6036c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776185372","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/af14409ecb8f994085d9fe3cf3f95161f8f53901/ss_af14409ecb8f994085d9fe3cf3f95161f8f53901.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778866613","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/452c51790649ace106943a390fa6d0d6d08aa146/ss_452c51790649ace106943a390fa6d0d6d08aa146.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778866613","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/035a7bff9ead957f89e86b16e8187b6da6989ba1/ss_035a7bff9ead957f89e86b16e8187b6da6989ba1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778866613","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/b01bc929cd40bdc31aaf8691fa90b4fe3b81666b/ss_b01bc929cd40bdc31aaf8691fa90b4fe3b81666b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778866613","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/1575b05633bd2371ac3a0a8ba65c18d076ce5301/ss_1575b05633bd2371ac3a0a8ba65c18d076ce5301.1920x1080.jpg?t=1778866613"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are stuck in a haunted mansion and desperately need to find the bathroom. Your goal: navigate the haunted halls and survive ghostly encounters to reach the porcelain promised land to escape before your bowels betray you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/273e9f521c863adebc7a7b0113cc9f99.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3193c62fa0f3972c424a61eb8cca1e20.avif?t=1778866613\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear, stress, and bad burritos all push your gut closer to disaster. Manage your bowels carefully - make better food choices, fart to relieve the pressure, and more, all before you become a pile of poo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/a598db12f8e4bdd75a68bfafe9b36ede.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/600e6d2ce7ff8e169a75ddae349cc0ee.avif?t=1778866613\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TP Mummies, turd mobs and a host of other horrors lurk in the darkness, waiting to scare your pants off. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/e4a7be3faaa7205ee8345ca70c0f8b4c.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e6b2d806d1d99e1a16a54fdc9be9702.avif?t=1778866613\" width=500 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up lanterns, wield wonky weapons, and fling fancy furniture to break open doors, solve haunted puzzles, and keep ghosts at bay (or just throw s#!t at your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/09706defb9a9d57dc4a240f20eb35d83.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/41c023f5d06a290f25101712642c9032.avif?t=1778866613\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge clothes from corpses to mix up your style. Then die, and return as a playable poop, only to be reborn again with an even better fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/90f430c955c455584d839d961761dbfc.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/d479e99f517fc814a7f4687a3adfabf1.avif?t=1778866613\" width=500 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The procedurally generated mansion won’t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden, and haunted... Can your team survive and extract via the porcelain throne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.poster.avif?t=1778866613\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.webm?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/55c3cebbe3d13e5925fc9c2b0f31184c.mp4?t=1778866613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9 Gen / AMD Ryzen 3 4100 4 cores 3.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8 Gen / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6 cores 3.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["FuzzyBot"],"publishers":["Mad Mushroom"],"release_date":"Apr 14, 2026"}